                                    text="&lt;ol>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>INSTITUTO NACIONAL DE CÂNCER JOSÉ ALENCAR GOMES DA SILVA. Estimativa 2023: Incidência de câncer no Brasil. Rio de Janeiro: INCA, 2022. Disponível em: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.inca.gov.br/sites/ufu.sti.inca.local/files/media/document/estimativa-2023.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.inca.gov.br/sites/ufu.sti.inca.local/files/media/document/estimativa-2023.pdf&lt;/a>. Acesso em: 16 abr. 2025.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>AMERICAN CANCER SOCIETY. Signs and symptoms of ovarian cancer. Disponível em: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/ovarian-cancer/detection-diagnosis-staging/signs-and-symptoms.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/ovarian-cancer/detection-diagnosis-staging/signs-and-symptoms.html&lt;/a>. Acesso em: 16 abr. 2025.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>EUROPEAN SOCIETY FOR MEDICAL ONCOLOGY. Ovarian cancer – guide for patients. Disponível em: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esmo.org/for-patients/patient-guides/ovarian-cancer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>https://www.esmo.org/for-patients/patient-guides/ovarian-cancer.&lt;/a> Acesso em: 16 abr. 2025.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;Todos os Direitos Reservados. BR-ONC-250015. Aprovado em abril/2025.&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ol>&#xd;&#xa;"
